// ContextMod Devvit — starter config (seeded on install).
//
// Mods edit this at r/<your-sub>/wiki/botconfig/contextmod after install.
// The app polls the wiki every 5 minutes; "ContextMod: Reload config from
// wiki" from the mod overflow menu triggers an immediate refresh.
//
// Reference: ../README.md "Config schema" + AJV schema at src/schema/app.schema.json
// (shipped Phase 1 — Vinh's commit 6694109, 2026-05-16).
//
// Schema notes:
//   - Top-level keys: dryRun, needsAuthorEnrichment, namedRules, runs.
//     `schema_version` is NOT a valid top-level key (AJV strict mode rejects it).
//   - Checks use `combinator: 'AND' | 'OR'` (NOT `condition`).
//   - Check filters: `filters: { authorIs: {...}, itemIs: {...} }` short-circuit
//     before rule eval — saves the run loop a lookup when the post obviously
//     can't trip the rule (e.g., mod-authored).
//   - Rules: `regex` / `author` / `ruleset` / `named` / `repost`.
//   - `regex` shape: `{kind, pattern: string, flags?, target: 'title'|'body'|'url'}`.
//   - Actions: `remove` / `approve` / `lock` / `comment` / `report` / `ban` / `userFlair`.
//     Comment uses `template:` (NOT `body:`). Remove uses `isSpam:` (NOT `spam:`).
//   - Mustache template context: {{item.title}}, {{author.name}}, etc.
//     Render-time escapeMarkdown defaults on per Codex H4 — raw {{...}} is safe.
{
  // SAFETY: ships behind dryRun:true. Actions are SIMULATED — the Observatory
  // dashboard shows what would have happened with a 'dry-run' badge instead
  // of executing. Watch for ~1 day on your sub, then flip to false when
  // comfortable that the regex doesn't false-positive on legit threads.
  dryRun: true,
  runs: [
    {
      name: 'spam-removal',
      checks: [
        {
          name: 'crypto-giveaway',
          combinator: 'OR',
          // Don't fire on posts authored by mods or approved contributors.
          filters: { authorIs: { isMod: false, isContributor: false } },
          rules: [
            { kind: 'regex', name: 'scam-words', pattern: 'crypto|giveaway|scam|free\\s+nft', flags: 'i' },
          ],
          actions: [
            { kind: 'remove', isSpam: true },
            {
              kind: 'comment',
              template: 'Hi {{author.name}}, your post "{{item.title}}" was removed as suspected spam. Mod team will review on appeal.',
            },
          ],
        },
      ],
    },
  ],
}
